    "Name": "Suzumebachi Attack Helicopter",
    "Details": "Produced at the heigh of the Star League, the Suzumebachi was House Kuritas premier vtol. Dependant on soon to be lostech, the Suzumebachi was lost to the depredations of the Succession Wars. With a top speed of just shy of 130 kph, the 25 ton Suzumebachi is slow for its size but is well armored with 4 tons of Ferro-Fibrous armor providing protection. A single ER PPC is the VTOLs only weapon.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: This unit can not deploy in Lunar biomes.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 8/12 hexes / 240/360 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       110     15\n<b>Left</b>          75     15\n<b>Right</b>        75     15\n<b>Rear</b>         65     15\n\n<b>Total</b>      340     75</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Accurate Weapon - PPC</color>",
